Indonesian administrative names and code hierarchy

Derived from cahyadsn/wilayah, db/wilayah.sql, commit
c2eff0881e3c75b8822f8c84ea9d23affc11aadb:
https://github.com/cahyadsn/wilayah

The source cites Kepmendagri No. 300.2.2-2138 Tahun 2025. The repository
README refers to amendment No. 300.2.2-2430 Tahun 2025. Only administrative
codes and names are included, not coordinates, polygons or postal data.
No Google Maps-derived coordinates from other project files are included.
See id-hierarchy.sources.json for the source and derivative checksums.

